      "value": "As additional explanation: The 'Delay' state does nothing special here. It only waits 1 second, when I set 'Tracking Control' back to 'Tracking'. This way, the animation can termiate correctly and will not be interupted by a suddenly blinking.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
